	(text "PCM3168A at 48 kHz: I2C 0x44 (MODE = DGND, ADR0 = GND, ADR1 10k to GND). SCKI 24.576 MHz = 512 fS, single-rate 24-bit\nI2S-mode TDM, BCK 256 fS = 12.288 MHz: DOUT1 = ADC1-6, DIN1 = DAC1-8 (DOUT2 open, DIN2-4 GND).\nDAC slots: VOUT5 SEND A, VOUT3 SEND B, VOUT4 MAIN, VOUT1 USB 1, VOUT2 USB 2 (net DACn = output n).\nStand-alone / chain master: ADC = clock master, DAC slave on the tied BCK/LRCK. Clock slave (LINK_N low):\nADC + DAC slaves, U11 feeds the link SCKI, U13 the link BCK/LRCK. Firmware: SEAD = 1, REVAD = 1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 39.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "140e0775-c460-5821-8b96-b048657c42e2")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR MULTI-MIX - carrier (jack board), S3. Digital 4-channel mixer: 4 IN + 2 RETURN, SEND A / SEND B / MAIN OUT, 15 knobs read by the MCU (MIDI CC), USB audio + MIDI, PCM3168A at 48 kHz, clock link. Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1d094e5b-927e-5719-8061-636cbb4d3174")
	)
	(text "MCU BOARD LINK: J12/J13 1x12 2.54 mm male strips (plastic on the carrier F side);\nthe MCU board (multi-mix-mcu, J112/J113) solders on top. BOOT/RESET and SWD on the carrier (B side):\nhold BOOT, press RESET = CH32V307 ROM bootloader on the USB-C. I2C pull-ups are on the MCU board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 579.12 50.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1d4a2db4-79a0-5812-9895-15a1ef8d7e3b")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: GND/+12V/-12V at J8; +12V_F/-12V_F behind D2/D1; V5_IN behind R1||R2; V3_IN behind FB2 + R3; +3V3 behind L1; +5VA at R8; +3V3_C behind FB1; +3V3_OSC behind R21; +3V3_POT behind R62."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "23d66344-e0ce-507b-9919-014306e4ef69")
	)
	(text "NORM: all six jack normals on one node; NORM_PROBE (PA8) pseudo-random bits via 100k/1k = 33 mV: the firmware\ncorrelates it in each ADC channel to tell patched from unpatched (RTN A/B unpatched -> returns from USB)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 350.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "3d6e862b-1c68-5096-bd39-16e1119e5e68")
	)
	(text "VCOM (+5VA): U6C buffers VCOMAD -> 100R / 10u -> VCOM_REF (VIN1-6 - and the driver + inputs). U6D, U7D spare."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 375.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7745cc8f-3f9c-5fa7-9580-4aae8da1ef53")
	)
	(text "INPUTS (x6: CH1-4, RTN A/B): jack (TN = NORM) -> 10u -> 100k -> inverting driver on +5VA (-0.2, + at VCOM_REF)\n-> 470R / 2.2n C0G -> VINn+ (single-ended). +/-7.07 V = 1 Vrms ADC full scale. 100k, AC-coupled (modules/4mix D3)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8bf2a8ee-6ffc-5d9c-9709-c028dd780d4c")
	)
	(text "OUTPUTS (x5): DAC1 SEND A (J1, VOUT5), DAC2 SEND B (J2, VOUT3), DAC3 MAIN OUT (J5, VOUT4) on U7A-C; DAC4 USB 1\n(J9, VOUT1), DAC5 USB 2 (J10, VOUT2) on U8 (host-assigned outs, bottom right); VOUT6-8 open. Difference amplifier on +/-12 V (15k / 27k || 47p,\ngain 1.8) -> 2k || 2k (1k / 0.5 W) -> jack. Full scale +/-7.2 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 246.38 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8caa644a-edc3-58f8-afbc-a2b56313e93b")
	)
	(text "+3V3 BUCK, kept out of the audio:\n- only the digital rail is switched; +5VA stays linear\n- U2 is the FCCM TPS562208: fixed ~580 kHz at every load\n  (TPS562201 pulse-skips into the audio band: do not substitute)\n- FB2 + R3 2.2R + C6/C7 keep its switching current off +12V_F\n- L1 molded; FB1 filters the codec VDD / clock logic, R21/C43 Y1"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 116.84 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9325d145-7c2d-5d23-ad9c-a19abc017fff")
	)
	(text "DC REFERENCE (kept from modules/usb-audio-max): +5VA sets the codec gain (DAC 1.6 x VCC, ADC 0.2 x VCC):\nU9 REF5050A -> R6 10k / C19 1u -> V5_SET -> U1A LM358 -> R9 -> Q1 BCP56 -> R8 -> +5VA;\nR7 10k senses +5VA at the codec; C37 22n + R16 47k = PI compensation. Q2 limits at ~0.3-0.35 A."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a5e7d000-0e3a-5d4d-9263-f89621c7744e")
	)
	(text "KNOBS: 15 x RV09 50k B (modules/4mix references) as DC dividers on +3V3_POT; nothing on them carries audio.\nWiper 100n -> U10 74HC4067 (I0-I14, I15 = GND) -> R61 1k -> POT_ADC (MCU PC1 = ADC_IN11); S0-S3 = PC2, PC3, PA0, PA1.\nThe firmware scans them, smooths with hysteresis and sends MIDI CC (VOL as CC7 per channel)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 360.68 424.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "afc7f869-fee8-5e96-8926-5f4115037463")
	)
	(text "CLOCK LINK (keyed 2x5 IDC daisy chain, straight ribbon CLK OUT -> next unit CLK IN; master = the unit with CLK IN open):\n1 DET | 2 NC | 3 GND | 4 SCKI | 5 GND | 6 BCK | 7 LRCK | 8 GND | 9 NC | 10 NC  (Eurorack power cable safe)\nClock only (sample-locked USB multitrack): each unit keeps its own USB and outputs. Up to 4 units until bench-tested.\nLINK_N low (CLK IN connected) = clock slave: U11 takes SCKI and U13 BCK/LRCK from the link, by hardware;\nU14A/U12 repeat them out of CLK OUT to the next unit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 459.74 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b5234f3f-2712-510e-8668-a4c5a1231e54")
	)
	(text "POWER (as modules/usb-audio-max): +12V -> D2 -> +12V_F (output op-amps; R1||R2 16.5R -> Q1 BCP56 (U1A LM358 loop, ref U9 REF5050) -> +5VA; FB2 + R3 -> U2 TPS562208 FCCM buck -> L1 -> +3V3 -> FB1 -> +3V3_C -> R21 -> +3V3_OSC); -12V -> D1 -> -12V_F. +12 V ~0.32 A max, -12 V ~10 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ea1360bf-2fe0-5e95-b746-92a792f0cd2a")
	)
